+/// The fallback servers in what the app reports ("ip,ip,..."), minus every
+/// address that cannot be the underlying network's DNS: this VPN's own
+/// addresses (the engine's sockets bypass the VPN, so asking 10.53.0.1 from
+/// here goes out on the real network and is never answered), loopback,
